{"symbol":"EKENNIS","yahoo":"EKENNIS.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Ekennis Software Service Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Information Technology Services","website":"https://www.ekennis.com","about":"Ekennis Software Service Limited provides software IT consulting and services in India. It operates through Software IT Consulting and Services; and FMCG Consulting, Printing, Branding, and Packaging segments. The company offers e-commerce platforms, mobile applications, inventory management, ERP consulting, SAP-related services, Microsoft and Oracle solutions, and business software integrations; e-commerce development; IT product/software development; specialized software training; and printing, designing, and packaging solutions. It also provides brand development and packaging solutions, including design, consulting, and production support. In addition, the company offers web development services, including websites, e-commerce, web application, content management systems, and low-code development; digital marketing services, such as media planning and buying, banner ads and retargeting, CRM and ORM, email and social campaigns, and influencer marketing; SEO services; digital laminated printing services; and ready-to-use packaging solutions, including custom printed stand-up and stand-up zip lock pouches, three-side seal and flat pouches, retort and spout pouches, custom labels and stickers, paper boxes and folding cartons, rigid boxes, kraft paper boxes, bio boxes and kraft trays, glass jars and containers, tin jars and metal packaging, and non-printed food-safe pouches, as well as custom packaging for food, FMCG, spices, dry fruits, cosmetics, personal care, and other consumer products under the Myperfectpack brand. It serves startups, MSMEs, entrepreneurs, growing and larger businesses, D2C brands, and enterprise customers. Ekennis Software Service Limited was incorporated in 2019 and is based in Bengaluru, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:20:24+00:00","quote":{"price":39.61,"prevClose":39.61,"marketCap":5.55,"high52":168.0,"low52":37.91,"pe":null,"bookValue":17.13,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":-34.72,"shares":0.14,"insiders":76.91,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2022-03-07","2022-03-08","2022-03-09","2022-03-10","2022-03-11","2022-03-14","2022-03-15","2022-03-16","2022-03-17","2022-03-21","2022-03-22","2022-03-23","2022-03-24","2022-03-25","2022-03-28","2022-03-29","2022-03-30","2022-03-31","2022-04-01","2022-04-04","2022-04-05","2022-04-06","2022-04-07","2022-04-08","2022-04-11","2022-04-12","2022-04-13","2022-04-18","2022-04-19","2022-04-20","2022-04-21","2022-04-22","2022-04-25","2022-04-26","2022-04-27","2022-04-28","2022-04-29","2022-05-02","2022-05-04","2022-05-05","2022-05-06","2022-05-09","2022-05-10","2022-05-11","2022-05-12","2022-05-13","2022-05-16","2022-05-17","2022-05-18","2022-05-19","2022-05-20","2022-05-23","2022-05-24","2022-05-25","2022-05-26","2022-05-27","2022-05-30","2022-05-31","2022-06-01","2022-06-02","2022-06-03","2022-06-06","2022-06-07","2022-06-08","2022-06-09","2022-06-10","2022-06-13","2022-06-14","2022-06-15","2022-06-16","2022-06-17","2022-06-20","2022-06-21","2022-06-22","2022-06-23","2022-06-24","2022-06-27","2022-06-28","2022-06-29","2022-06-30","2022-07-01","2022-07-04","2022-07-05","2022-07-06","2022-07-07","2022-07-08","2022-07-11","2022-07-12","2022-07-13","2022-07-14","2022-07-15","2022-07-18","2022-07-19","2022-07-20","2022-07-21","2022-07-22","2022-07-25","2022-07-26","2022-07-27","2022-07-28","2022-07-29","2022-08-01","2022-08-02","2022-08-03","2022-08-04","2022-08-05","2022-08-08","2022-08-10","2022-08-11","2022-08-12","2022-08-16","2022-08-17","2022-08-18","2022-08-19","2022-08-22","2022-08-23","2022-08-24","2022-08-25","2022-08-26","2022-08-29","2022-08-30","2022-09-01","2022-09-02","2022-09-05","2022-09-06","2022-09-07","2022-09-08","2022-09-09","2022-09-12","2022-09-13","2022-09-14","2022-09-15","2022-09-16","2022-09-19","2022-09-20","2022-09-21","2022-09-